  "body": "Four Bedrooms. Four Bathrooms. Freedom to Live Your Way.\r\n\r\nStandalone and freehold. There's a lot more to this modern Eastern Bays home than meets the eye.\r\n\r\nLove Auckland but also love spending time overseas? Why not enjoy the best of both worlds?\r\n\r\nSpacious enough to enjoy when you're home, yet easy to lock up and leave when it's time to travel. No large gardens or endless maintenance, just the freedom to come and go as you please.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across three split levels, connected by short half-flights of stairs, this four-bedroom home offers a clever balance of shared living and private spaces. Ideal for families, multigenerational living, teenagers, guests or flatmates, with room for everyone to enjoy their independence.\r\n\r\nHere's what makes it worth a look:\r\n\r\n*  Four bedrooms, four bathrooms plus a guest toilet - including two ground-floor bedrooms with their own ensuites, ideal for extended family, guests or flatmates to help with the mortgage.\r\n\r\n*  Modern Miele-equipped kitchen - with separate dining and comfortable living areas.\r\n\r\n*  Private upper-level master suite - a peaceful retreat away from the main living spaces.\r\n\r\n*  Flexible spaces - for working from home, studying or simply enjoying extra room.\r\n\r\n*  Standalone and freehold - no shared walls, with easy-care outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\n*  Internal-access garage plus off-street parking - everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n*  Stamford Builders Insurance guarantee - added peace of mind, subject to applicable terms.\r\n\r\nWalk. Bike. Train. Beach.\r\n\r\nEnjoy morning walks around ÅŒrakei Basin, the leafy trails of Kepa Bush Reserve or the waterfront at Mission Bay and Tamaki Drive. ÅŒrakei Bay Village offers cafés, restaurants, Farro Fresh and Silky Otter Cinemas, while Eastridge Shopping Centre and convenient transport connections make everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nWhether you're spending time between New Zealand and overseas, downsizing or looking for a spacious family home that doesn't tie you down, this property offers the flexibility to live life your way.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted, it also offers an option for investors seeking a low-maintenance Eastern Bays property.\r\n\r\nThe developer is moving on to the next project, and this home is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nA home to enjoy when you're here. Easy to leave when you're away. And always a place to come back to.\r\n\r\nCome and see what's possible.\r\n\r\nOpen homes as advertised. Private viewings welcome.\r\n\r\nKristy Chen | 020 4149 0233\r\nAngelina Vihrova | 021 727 751\r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents welcome.",
